  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tonga-Australia Policing Partnership (TAPP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The AFP supports Tonga Police through the Tonga-Australia Partnership Program (TAPP). The overarching goal of the partnership is that &#x201c;communities in Tonga are safe and secure, especially for women, girls and marginalised groups.&#x201d; Three Partnership Outcomes support this goal: Enhanced national security, focusing on illicit drugs and transnational crime; Improved frontline response to survivors of family violence (including through the Families Free of Violence program); and Strengthened capacity and capability for ethical and effective policing.</narrative>
  </description>
